Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無盡的一學期已經重複了無數次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己一直活在大家的庇護下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你肯跟我這種傻瓜一起玩鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能遇上你們這種朋友 我幸福死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至讓我無法想像沒有你們的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就有這麼幸福!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.87,0:02:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想永遠陪著你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對你們的不捨 勝過你們任何人!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我卻不得不拋下你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不帶這樣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:31.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這是要去哪兒 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.19,0:02:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跑出這封閉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經無法回頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們兩個 必須邁向未來!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 我渾身都疼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡…是哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回到…現實世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6月的最後一週
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們坐上了修學旅行的巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是覺得恭介肯定就在這輛巴士上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:11.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這倆巴士上?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒看到他那一臉想跟我們一起去的表情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那小子都三年級了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年應該就參加過修學旅行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是那種為了玩樂不擇手段的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估計是躲在哪兒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真人救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而謙吾…救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站得起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我試試
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都…困在那裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這氣味…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽油洩漏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一引著了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 由你來保護鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在這裡會被波及的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們只能盡快逃離
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果讓鈴遭遇危險 恭介為我做的一切就全白費了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介…我照你說的做了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是這麼說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「在沒了大伙的世界裡 你要保護好鈴 好好活下去」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你的心願
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了恭介 沒了大伙的世界我才不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我要違抗你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在這裡別動 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要救出…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西園同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偏偏這種時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 要睡過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能…睡倒在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會倖存的是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 還有鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經…太遲了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有我珍視的人們…都會…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 我遇到過一件可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 一點都不懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按住她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為世上充滿了這種既可怕又討厭的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一直封閉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起出去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介一直陪在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天起他就是我們的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是謙吾 以後一起玩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是理樹 他今天起就是我們Little Busters的一員了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊 這邊這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好詐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:12.34,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為我們永遠不會分離
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以哭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某地有位企鵝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企鵝先生老是失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,經常被小貓先生小狗先生及其他人嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊 最後星星會讓它坐到自己的背上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我做企鵝先生好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬要做星星嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 想放棄時就念一遍樂觀小咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起來喊一次「好勒!」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全身就會充滿樂觀力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為鈴醬幸福 我就幸福嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直沒能想起…小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒能想起…我最喜歡的小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有大家…我也一直沒想起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的事 不想面對的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至連大家也被我拋之腦後 只顧封閉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找回丟失的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看的是什麼書啊 美魚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短歌集
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我借你看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不需要 你直說就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗同學這種不善言表的一面我很喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人希望你能永遠這麼淳樸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會這麼想是否緣於我的任性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美魚…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然閃過了在下的劍 簡直無禮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葉…葉留佳好吵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這就是本人的賣點嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬也試試盡全力鬧騰一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定就能找到真正的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葉留佳!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐過來 鈴君
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不聽大姐姐的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開啦 蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 居然敢反抗大姐姐 這個鈴君真沒規矩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好啦 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴君真是夠內向的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要更積極些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你變積極 就能做到很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來谷…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特萊爾加和貝爾加都超喜歡鈴的說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們說和鈴待在一起就感覺很安適
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗狗們這麼說的?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能聽懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和庫特待在一起就覺得很安適
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和鈴同學在一起也感覺超安適的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:16:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Love&Peace會無限增殖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我過的非常 非常快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也學到了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家給了我很多寶物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我連一句謝謝都沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個啊 也是許願星哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這邊就算我的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個就用來達成鈴醬的願望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要許什麼願?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬幫我決定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 說好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了鈴醬 我會幫忙想好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定幫你想出個最棒的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,約定…許願…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬還沒告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬…醬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直一直沒能告訴你真相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家已經都離開了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事要收尾了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…小毬醬呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我很早前就該離開的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我無論如何也想最後再見鈴醬一面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的任性 讓我留了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這表示我以後再也見不到你了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要見不到小毬醬 也不要見不到恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要真人和謙吾消失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有葉留佳 美魚 庫特 來谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要她們任何一個消失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要大家都在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬…真是個愛哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬才是愛哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊 我在笑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為理樹君和鈴醬曾在這裡教過我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使悲劇發生 最後還是能笑出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望鈴醬也能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我們說好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送給鈴醬一個心願
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願鈴醬也能這樣笑出來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能…哭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬希望我笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎樣才能實現小毬醬的心願呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎樣才能笑得出來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:21:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能再看到大家的笑容 那我就笑得出來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要救出…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能就這麼結束!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再封閉下去我以後還會後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直這麼消極小毬醬會傷心的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要迎難而上!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.40,0:21:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要救出所有人!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定很困難
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我知道面對困難時應該說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬告訴過我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好勒!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要和大家再度一同歡笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬的心願…我一定實現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\pos(744,350)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}第12話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\an6\pos(818,380)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}一個心願
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跨過最後的試煉…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 Little Busters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:15.32,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとりじゃ寂しい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:21.63,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:32.61,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:40.34,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:46.41,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:52.99,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ばらばらになる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:56.78,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとつずつ消えてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:03.46,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}目覚める日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:13.09,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}とっとと走っていけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:27.83,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}祭りのあとのようで 寂しいだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:15.32,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一個人太孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:21.63,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}才會牽起彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:32.61,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}但這樣只會讓人無法成長
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:40.34,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}無論如何我都要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:46.41,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}牽起的手就要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:52.99,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}四散分離
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:56.78,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}逐一消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:03.46,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}向著夢醒之日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:13.09,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}大步向前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:27.83,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}恰如曲終人散時 空剩寂寥
