Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:50.68,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我們在此相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:57.81,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}不知何時 微風在身邊刮起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:03.21,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}但我並不是你
